# Prompts

`entrevistador.txt` is spoken English: one question per turn, no correction, no score, no markdown.

`feedback.txt` is Brazilian Portuguese in exactly three blocks: `Pontos positivos`, `Pontos de melhoria`, `Próximo passo`. Each comment quotes the transcript. An empty or noisy transcript is an insufficient sample. Do not claim fluency.

Do not add a sample answer that could be read as a real candidate turn.
